{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tree_spruce","model_identifier":"tree_spruce","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tree_spruce\n\nReference spruce: a dense dark cone right to the ground, about 8 m (284 u).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -60..60, y 0..295, z -60..60 units (3.38 x 8.30 x 3.38 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 512 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 35.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- trunk: 12 x 284 x 12 at the origin (the solid, blocking part)\n- canopy: see bounds; units walk under it\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rustle` | 5.0 | loop | canopy bones sway very slightly (trunk still) |\n| `hit` | 0.4 | once | canopy shivers after an axe strike |\n| `fall` | 2.5 | once | whole `tree` group tips over sideways onto +X about the trunk base edge, hits at 1.5 s, bounces once, settles by 2.1 s; canopy whips on impact |\n\n## Notes\n\n- `rustle` and `hit` move only the canopy groups; `fall` rotates the `tree` group (pivot on the trunk base edge on +X), so the trunk lies along +X after 1.5 s (it stops short of flat where the crown meets the ground). Swap to the `_stump` model (and spawn the `_log_pile`) once it has settled.\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"trunk","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.199999999999999,0.0,-7.199999999999999],"to":[7.199999999999999,274.4444,7.199999999999999],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[7.199999999999999,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[73,0,87.4,274.4444],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[73,0,87.4,274.4444],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[73,0,87.4,274.4444],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[73,0,87.4,274.4444],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[149,0,163.4,14.4],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[149,0,163.4,14.4],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"5f4c3dc7-e259-5fa4-901c-69acc7ec75fa"},{"name":"tier0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,70.20605999999998,-29.760000000000005],"to":[48.0,82.44037999999998,29.760000000000005],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,70.20605999999998,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,96.0,663.9414],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,138.32,679.9414],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,96.0,663.9414],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,138.32,679.9414],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[378.0,275.8,474.0,335.32],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,363.8,96.0,423.32],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1e20cd20-5661-5c66-ac99-bd8bd65873b4"},{"name":"tier0x","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-29.760000000000005,70.20605999999998,-48.0],"to":[29.760000000000005,82.44037999999998,48.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,70.20605999999998,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,138.32,679.9414],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,96.0,663.9414],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[78.8,667.7071,138.32,679.9414],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,651.7071,96.0,663.9414],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12.8,0.0,72.32,96.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[88.8,0.0,148.32,96.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8d0c0b89-b29a-5ca8-9a49-d25f2de99b11"},{"name":"tier0c","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-33.6,82.44037999999998,-33.6],"to":[33.6,94.67478,33.6],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,70.20605999999998,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[416.0,651.4141,483.2,663.6484],"tex